{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 7180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1720, "text": "Previously on Night Court... This is a\nvial of experimental bacteria."}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 12280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 8900, "text": "No one knows what horrible plague we've\nconcocted here."}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 16360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 15180, "text": "Is that door sealed?"}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 21020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 16820, "text": "Good. We don't want any more people\nexposed. No telling what effect this"}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 22020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 21020, "text": "has had."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 23920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 22440, "text": "So all we can do is wait?"}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 27680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 24680, "text": "One way or another, fate brought us all\nhere tonight."}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 30700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 28280, "text": "What brought us all here tonight is our\nlousy jobs."}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 37340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 32119, "text": "I can't speak for you, Dan, but I think\nfate played a hand in me getting my job."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 44500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 39680, "text": "I was going to be a big -time magician\nuntil my agent dropped dead."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 47520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 46180, "text": "I have a story, too."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 52140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 48260, "text": "Like Harry's, it was about a crucial\nturning point in my life. I was 19 years"}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 55820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 52140, "text": "old, and I was the contestant in the\nMiss Greater Buffalo beauty pageant."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 58060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 56200, "text": "I lost because I took a stand."}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 62800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 59160, "text": "I bet Roz is one of those lucky types\nwho knew what she wanted right from the"}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 63779, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 62800, "text": "start, right?"}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 64780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 63780, "text": "Wrong."}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 68240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 64940, "text": "All I knew was I liked wearing a uniform\nand working with people."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 73920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 72560, "text": "So you know what the virus is?"}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 75260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 74260, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 80520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 75560, "text": "We put a rat in with the culture that we\nmade, and it died almost instantly."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 86450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 85450, "text": "So a rat died."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 89430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 86750, "text": "I mean, it may not be deadly to humans."}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 91230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 89910, "text": "Well, what if it is?"}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 93450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 91710, "text": "Oh, we patented immediately."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 99390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 95130, "text": "I think what she means is, did we get\nenough exposure to be harmful?"}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 101310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 100130, "text": "I don't think so."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 104350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 101670, "text": "Oh, thank God. I was so worried."}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 109650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 104590, "text": "But just in case, you might want to give\nyour stenographer here any messages"}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 111790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 109650, "text": "that you have for somebody on the\noutside."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 115230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 113050, "text": "You mean like a goodbye message?"}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 121050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 115610, "text": "Oh, don't think of it that way. Think of\nit as a see you later, maybe message."}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 125390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 124390, "text": "So it's come to this."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 129949, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 128729, "text": "Oh, that's strange."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 134350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 130150, "text": "You know, I never guessed what I would\nsay if I was in a situation like this."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 137690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 134390, "text": "But now that I am, somehow it seems all\nvery clear."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 140710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 139430, "text": "Lizette, would you want to take a\nletter?"}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 141950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 140950, "text": "Sure, Dan."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 148940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 144420, "text": "Darling, I hope you will forgive me for\nthe often uncaring way that I've treated"}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 154520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 148940, "text": "you. I find that only now, facing death,\nhave I the courage to say, I love you."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 158060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 155580, "text": "Your memory is with me and sustains me."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 163540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 159640, "text": "Okay, now, send it to all the names in\nhere with three stars."}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 210940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 208460, "text": "Look, we've got to stop thinking it's\nover. We have to have hope."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 212259, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 211420, "text": "That's right."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 214620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 212260, "text": "The bacteria has not affected us."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 218980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 217340, "text": "Bacteria can be very tricky."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 223660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 219520, "text": "I once invented a bacteria that would\nactually eat oil spills."}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 226420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 224060, "text": "No kidding. That sounds great. Did it\nwork?"}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 228760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 226640, "text": "Oh, yes. It ate the oil spill all right."}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 231700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 228960, "text": "Then it ate the tanker, two barges, and\na club of men."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 238500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 234640, "text": "Always thinking we can outsmart nature,\nand she's always proving us wrong."}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 240660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 239240, "text": "This is all my fault."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 242400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 240960, "text": "I broke the test tube."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 247700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 243360, "text": "Come on, big guy. It could have happened\nto anyone."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 250840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 248520, "text": "Thanks, Harry, but I have a confession\nto make."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 253800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 252000, "text": "I screw up all the time."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 256720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 255720, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 260880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 258640, "text": "It's true. Ever since I was a kid."}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 265110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 262040, "text": "Once I disobeyed my mom and... Lost\nevery cent we had."}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 267910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 266150, "text": "Really? What happened?"}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 274470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 269070, "text": "Well... It was a critical time for me\nand my entire family."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 276050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 274970, "text": "We were broke."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 278270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 276590, "text": "We couldn't even buy food."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 285650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 281810, "text": "Finally, Mom said we had no choice but\nto sell our cow."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 288290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 286190, "text": "So I took Betsy to town."}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 304120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 299020, "text": "But before I got there, I ran into a guy\nwho said he would buy the cow in"}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 306940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 304120, "text": "exchange for a bag of magic beans."}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 312440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 308840, "text": "So when Mom found out, she got mad and\nthrew the beans out the window."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 317000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 313260, "text": "And the next morning, you discovered\nthat they'd grown into a giant"}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 318520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 317460, "text": "I've told you this before?"}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 325820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 321660, "text": "That isn't from your life. That's the\nstory of Jack and the Beanstalk."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 327860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 326740, "text": "Oh, yeah. Sorry."}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 331400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 330400, "text": "Now I remember."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 333920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 331540, "text": "What I wanted to tell you was the story\nof me and my dad."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 337540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 335120, "text": "Bull, I've never heard you mention your\ndad before."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 341220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 338200, "text": "He sent me away when I was young and I\nnever saw him again."}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 342980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 341980, "text": "Oh, how sad."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 344240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 343240, "text": "Why did he do that?"}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 346160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 345000, "text": "Because he loved me."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 350080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 347440, "text": "And things back home were real bad."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 359170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 357770, "text": "Your mother and I love you very much."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 362750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 360550, "text": "It breaks her heart to think of being\naway from you."}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 364990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 363550, "text": "But it's no longer safe here."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 370830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 365930, "text": "The time has come when, for your own\ngood, we must send you away."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 375230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 372030, "text": "I know you're frightened, but we're\nsending you to a safer place."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 381770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 380010, "text": "Things are much better where you're\ngoing."}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 385950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 382770, "text": "You'll grow up safer, healthier, even\nstronger."}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 394440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 392340, "text": "Goodbye, my son."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 429400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 428400, "text": "burned out in there."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 432200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 430060, "text": "You were telling us the story of\nSuperman."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 437440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 434140, "text": "Wait. What about the time I got bitten\nby this radioactive spider?"}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 442400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 440000, "text": "Oh, I am tired of this waiting."}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 446580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 443580, "text": "If we're all going to die horrible\ndeaths, I would at least like to get it"}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 447580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 446580, "text": "with."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 450160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 447620, "text": "Well, if you like that, I can help speed\nit along."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 454340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 451280, "text": "Come on, guys. You've got to stop\ntalking like this. We're not going to"}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 456080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 455080, "text": "She's right."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 458060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 456320, "text": "We haven't had any symptoms yet."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 462800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 458440, "text": "We're fine, and we're going to stay that\nway as long as we all pull together."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 465640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 462840, "text": "Come on. Right, right. Yeah, right."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 476640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 469680, "text": "Come on, we can't"}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 479880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 476640, "text": "jump to conclusions. Just because Matt\ncoughed doesn't mean that he's sick."}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 482580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 480540, "text": "Maybe he just swallowed a dust bunny."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 487730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 485710, "text": "though I have a strange ache in my\nthroat."}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 493790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 491550, "text": "I feel feverish."}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 497630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 496630, "text": "So do I."}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 507090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 502670, "text": "Me too."}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 510150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 508910, "text": "And I've got this pain."}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 511670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 510670, "text": "It's sharp."}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 514890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 511990, "text": "Piercing. Oh, you're sitting on the memo\nspike."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 522740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 520459, "text": "the virus could be a number of things."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 528060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 523740, "text": "Cholera, anthrax, even bubonic plague."}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 530860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 528780, "text": "That's it, I'm out of here. I can't take\nthis anymore."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 532300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 531300, "text": "Dan, relax."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 533580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 532440, "text": "Mark, I can't stand this."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 537220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 534000, "text": "I never had a disease that I didn't\nearn."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 540480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 539280, "text": "Dan, it'll be okay."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 544600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 540740, "text": "You never know what you're capable of\nsurviving until you're put to the test."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 546640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 545280, "text": "I found that out in Vietnam."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 555130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 552970, "text": "Yeah. How'd you get stuck with guard\nduty?"}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 560730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 556510, "text": "Oh, we can't all watch the USO show,\nHarry."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 563130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 561590, "text": "Somebody's got to guard the perimeter."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 566230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 565230, "text": "Nah."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 569370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 567210, "text": "Anyway, it's only fair to the other\nguys."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 572970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 570890, "text": "I'm going home in three days, man."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 579610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 574930, "text": "You are a serious short -timer, man.\nYeah, yeah, and that's what worries me."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 581810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 580810, "text": "Seems that..."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 584450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 582510, "text": "is the short timers that make the\nmistakes."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 587070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 586070, "text": "Don't worry."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 588690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 587570, "text": "You'll be getting out of here."}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 591650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 589690, "text": "Yeah? What then?"}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 598890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 593070, "text": "After all this, I mean, how do I just\npick up and go home like nothing"}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 602750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 600130, "text": "Well, you just handle it, you know?"}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 606490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 603430, "text": "You get a nice job with quiet, normal\npeople."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 609990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 608990, "text": "Hey."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 613760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 611760, "text": "Better go before you miss the gold\ndiggers."}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 617700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 615100, "text": "I gotta make an ammo check anyway."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 619060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 618060, "text": "All right."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 621820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 619720, "text": "I'll see you later then, huh? Yeah. Hey."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 623100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 622100, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 624340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 623340, "text": "Be careful."}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 625900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 624900, "text": "Hey, thanks, man."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 654630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 653270, "text": "Oh, man, you're just a kid."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 658650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 655030, "text": "Wait a minute. No, you don't. Hey, the\npalm down. I'm not going to hurt you."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 660750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 658810, "text": "Hey, watch it. That's a grenade."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 665090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 662470, "text": "Oh, man, you put a pin on it. We put a\npin."}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 666430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 665370, "text": "Hey, I'm going to kill you."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 669030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 668030, "text": "I'm going to kill you."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 671630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 669790, "text": "Now, don't move."}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 674250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 672530, "text": "If we both let it go, it'll blow up."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 678270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 676950, "text": "We got to find a pin."}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 679700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 678700, "text": "and put it back in there."}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 683520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 681200, "text": "Oh, man, look, hey, wait a minute. One\nof us is going to have to let it go."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 686640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 685640, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 693720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 690220, "text": "Uh -uh. Oh, no."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 696280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 695280, "text": "You're first."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 698160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 697160, "text": "Uh -uh."}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 699300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 698300, "text": "Oh, no."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 701220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 700120, "text": "You're first."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 705180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 703540, "text": "Man, we're not going to find a pen like\nthis."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 707840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 706640, "text": "Maybe I better just call for help."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 713480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 708100, "text": "No. No, no, no, I'm going to... They can\nhelp us find a pen, man. All right, all"}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 714700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 713480, "text": "right, all right, all right. Just take\nit easy."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 716860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 715720, "text": "Oh, man, I don't believe this."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 718480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 717480, "text": "Whoa, whoa, take it easy."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 720080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 718540, "text": "Hey, hey, hey, don't get nervous."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 722440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 720520, "text": "It's just the, uh, it's just the U .S\n.O. show."}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 725760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 724600, "text": "U .S .O.? Yeah, yeah."}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 727640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 726340, "text": "Uh -huh, yeah."}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 729360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 728360, "text": "Buku girls."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 731980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 730980, "text": "Hey, wait a minute."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 734740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 733680, "text": "Is that why you snuck up here?"}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 736540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 735540, "text": "To see the show?"}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 745880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 744880, "text": "I don't know anyway."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 753340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 746340, "text": "Oh, well, uh... He's just telling, uh...\nTelling jokes, uh... He said, uh..."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 755320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 753340, "text": "Nom wa."}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 760320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 756220, "text": "I saw, uh... Kanga de fry eggs."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 764180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 763700, "text": "That"}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 772220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 764180, "text": "is..."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 773220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 772220, "text": "That is funny, huh?"}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 784250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 780709, "text": "You haven't had an egg in two years?"}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 787810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 786810, "text": "Chicken's dead?"}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 793130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 789210, "text": "Oh, yeah, yeah, that's a... It's this\nwar, man."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 796550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 793790, "text": "Hey, but it's gonna be all over soon."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 801730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 798170, "text": "D .C. will be gone, and you'll have your\ncountry back."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 803550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 802550, "text": "You know?"}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 806440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 804940, "text": "Viet Cong got into the way."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 811560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 809320, "text": "We have saying."}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 815260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 813600, "text": "No good fight burglar."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 818880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 816260, "text": "If destroy own home."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 825540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 821960, "text": "This war is in our home."}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 830600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 829140, "text": "I know what you mean, man."}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 833900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 832900, "text": "Look."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 840090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 834430, "text": "But I don't know why these things have\nto happen to you, or whether we're doing"}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 846530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 840090, "text": "you any good here, but... Hey, I promise\nyou, man, I"}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 847830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 846530, "text": "won't hurt you."}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 857530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 851390, "text": "If you just let go, I'll try to get us\nboth out of this, man."}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 870440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 869439, "text": "What are you waiting for? Run!"}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 872580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 871580, "text": "Beat him up!"}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 906600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 901480, "text": "Anyway, after that, I figured I could go\nhome and settle down and work with"}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 907600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 906600, "text": "normal people."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 911820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 910020, "text": "Boy, did you miss the mark."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 920920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 913960, "text": "Well, whatever happens, I wouldn't give\nup working here and knowing"}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 921920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 920920, "text": "you guys."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 925440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 922480, "text": "Thanks, buddy. You too, huh? I would."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 931780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 927660, "text": "Yes. I'd give up knowing you to avoid\ndying in this lousy courtroom. Call me a"}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 932780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 931780, "text": "stick in the mud."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 936460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 934380, "text": "Come on, Dan. You belong here."}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 939660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 937800, "text": "Yeah. I suppose I do. Now."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 941060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 940060, "text": "But I didn't always."}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 942700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 941700, "text": "What do you mean?"}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 945000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 943160, "text": "Well, hey, I had a turning point, too."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 950260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 949260, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 953320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 952100, "text": "Next order of business."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 956320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 954220, "text": "Drolet versus Drolet."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 958060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 957040, "text": "Classic case."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 961680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 958560, "text": "Old man builds an empire selling hog\nsemen."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 966120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 962380, "text": "Then he dies and his kids commence to\nfighting over his money."}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 969900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 966700, "text": "Now, the brother has filed suit against\nhis sister."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 971940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 970280, "text": "How did the sister respond?"}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 974600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 972680, "text": "She sued him for divorce."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 978100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 976520, "text": "We got to keep that family together."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 979620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 978620, "text": "Any ideas?"}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 983380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 980420, "text": "Why don't we ask our new hotshot\nassociate?"}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 984820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 983820, "text": "Good idea."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 986620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 985620, "text": "Danny?"}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 994620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 990459, "text": "Sir, I happen to be reading over this\ncase before I went to bed last night."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 996000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 994740, "text": "Before you went to bed?"}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 998960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 996920, "text": "How old are you, boy? Twenty -five?"}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 1001700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 999860, "text": "Bedtime is not for working."}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 1006640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1002180, "text": "I hear Danny is not exactly experienced\nwith women folk."}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 1009020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1007140, "text": "You mean our Danny here is a virgin?"}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 1013920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1012540, "text": "Don't pay no mind to them, son."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 1017830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1014330, "text": "Tell us what you got. Well, I found a\nprecedent."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 1019570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1018150, "text": "In Miller v."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 1024470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1019870, "text": "Bartko, Judge Boudin ruled that\nperishable goods like hog semen should"}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 1028230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1024470, "text": "divided equally amongst the heirs to\navoid spoilage during litigation."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 1034190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1029190, "text": "Boy, you are wonder -mutt."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 1039050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1035970, "text": "I'm glad we outbid those other law firms\nto get him."}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 1043190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1039349, "text": "Cost us 57 an hour more, but worth every\npenny."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 1052530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1051530, "text": "new business?"}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 1053509, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1052710, "text": "Uh, no, sir."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 1057110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1053510, "text": "There's a case of Gilray Dupre's tractor\nrunning over Antoine's hog."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 1060270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1058630, "text": "We gotta win this for Gilray."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 1062570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1060850, "text": "He's our biggest cash cow."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 1064070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1063070, "text": "Bernard!"}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 1066970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1065210, "text": "Gilray, we were just talking about you."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 1072290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1067170, "text": "But I hope you worked up a defense on\nthis Antoine thing. I ain't paying for"}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 1073610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1072290, "text": "hog's hip surgery."}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 1077850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1074950, "text": "Of course we have, Gilray."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 1080540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1078160, "text": "You know we're the best firm in the tri\n-swamp area."}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 1086340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1080840, "text": "I know you're the best. It is our\ndefense that I'm concerned by."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 1090300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1087520, "text": "I was"}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 1097420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1090300, "text": "thinking"}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 1102540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1097420, "text": "that we could file a cross -claim\ncharging the hog with contributory"}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 1113450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1107850, "text": "Just like the son I never had, Danny,\nI'm going places, and I want you with"}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 1115690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1113530, "text": "Yes, sir. I'll start working on that\ncase right away."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 1124510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1118050, "text": "By the way, fellas, I want you to meet\nmy new wife, Evangeline."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 1145620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1144620, "text": "Please meet you."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 1151800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1148940, "text": "Hey, Danny, what do you say you work up\nthat brief while we take Gilray out for"}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 1152619, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1151800, "text": "some crawfish?"}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 1153720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1152620, "text": "Right on top of it, sir."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1160700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1156840, "text": "Oh, Gilray, you go ahead. I'm not hungry\nfor crawfish."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1162380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1161180, "text": "All right, baby."}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1167920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1165020, "text": "So, Danny, what you reading?"}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1170740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1168240, "text": "Oh, a fascinating history of swan toys\nthat you know."}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1172260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1171260, "text": "Better than 1920."}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1175680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1172360, "text": "In this parish, hogs had no legal\nrights. You don't say."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1178500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1176460, "text": "How about sex?"}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1181880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1179220, "text": "Uh, beg your pardon?"}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1185320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1182880, "text": "I mean, do you have any books on sex?"}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1186800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1185800, "text": "Um,"}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1189840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1187100, "text": "yeah. Right over there, second shelf."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1203440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1202440, "text": "You want me to what?"}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1206480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1204140, "text": "You and me."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1216500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1214040, "text": "Yes, I want us to do that."}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1219580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1218580, "text": "Oh, no!"}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1223200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1220360, "text": "You know, you see, I'm saving myself for\nmy future wife."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1227920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1223960, "text": "Oh, I'm being bad to keep your urges\nbottled up. You'll explode."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1230000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1228500, "text": "Well, no, no, no, see..."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1233620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1230320, "text": "I've seen what happens to fellas my age\nwho mess around."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1236920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1234140, "text": "They lose their concentration. First\nthing you know, that's all they can even"}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1239480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1236920, "text": "think of. Oh, Ben, hold on."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1242420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1239680, "text": "Raise down your pants and we'll pass a\ngood time."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1247640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1244860, "text": "Please don't tempt me."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1277200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1276200, "text": "Have no fear."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1279560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1278560, "text": "Danny's here."}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1288060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1286060, "text": "Gilray went on to be Carter's ambassador\nto France."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1290460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1289300, "text": "I could have gone with him."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1292900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1291860, "text": "Dan, Dan, Dan."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1294180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1293180, "text": "Yeah, I know."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1295820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1294260, "text": "I throw my life away for sex."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1301020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1297680, "text": "But you know, I thought at least I'd get\nto die having it."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1304940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1302600, "text": "Don't look at me or you'll die trying to\nhave it."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1316430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1312490, "text": "stories about your lives. I feel like I\nknow you people."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1321010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1318110, "text": "You do know us. You're the one who\nkilled us, remember?"}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1325390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1323210, "text": "Okay. We got the results."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1330690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1326790, "text": "It was tough work, but we finally\nisolated what was in that test tube."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1332310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1331310, "text": "Was it deadly?"}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1333550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1332550, "text": "Was it contagious?"}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1335870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1334470, "text": "It was pesto sauce!"}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1338650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1337650, "text": "Pesto sauce?"}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1344480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1339630, "text": "Evidently, the bacteria... was on the\nshelf at the lab's lunch orders, the"}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1345940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1344480, "text": "just grabbed the wrong container."}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1350240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1347560, "text": "Well, what about the rat that died when\nyou exposed it?"}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1354160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1350580, "text": "Well, it seems that we accidentally used\na rat from a smoking experiment."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1358540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1354620, "text": "He was already up to eight packs a day.\nI guess all that extra salt just pushed"}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1359540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1358540, "text": "him over the edge."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1364420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1361260, "text": "Well, wait a minute. We've been having\nsymptoms. Max's been coughing, and we've"}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1365920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1364420, "text": "all been feeling tired and feverish."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1368740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1366640, "text": "Come to think of it, you don't look too\ngood."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1374020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1370540, "text": "Seems like the early stages of... It's\nhim!"}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1375460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1374220, "text": "He's got the measles!"}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1376720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1375680, "text": "The measles!"}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1378700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1377700, "text": "Don't worry."}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1379780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1378780, "text": "It's not deadly."}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1381900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1380060, "text": "You'll all be fine in a few days."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1386400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1382600, "text": "Of course, in the meantime, we'll all\nhave to be quarantined. Oh, no."}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1390840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1387600, "text": "Great. They'll have time for me to tell\nmy real story."}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1396500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1392960, "text": "It's about me, a little dog, and a\nyellow brick road."}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1419090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1417809, "text": "Thank you."}
